  title: "Senior Staff Backend Engineer"
  description: "Company Introduction \_\n\nWe exist to wow our customers. We know\
    \ we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did we ever\
    \ live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and\
    \ living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar\
    \ e-commerce industry from the ground up. We are one of the fastest-growing e-commerce\
    \ companies that established an unparalleled reputation for being a dominant and\
    \ reliable force in South Korean commerce. \_\_\n\nWe are proud to have the best\
    \ of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public\
    \ company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the\
    \ speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded\
    \ by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are\
    \ bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on\
    \ impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the\
    \ company grow every day.\_\_\n\nOur mission to build the future of commerce is\
    \ real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break\
    \ traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this\
    \ always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world. \n \_\n\nRole Overview\n\n\
    We're looking for a Senior Staff Engineer to lead the technical direction of MyCoupang,\
    \ Coupang's post-purchase customer experience platform. Every order tracking,\
    \ delivery, return, payment, and support interaction for tens of millions of active\
    \ customers across Korea and Taiwan flows through this system.\_\n\nMyCoupang\
    \ operates at significant scale: ~34,000 requests per second, ~2.4 billion requests\
    \ daily, and ~16 billion weekly, served by 700+ production pods with a 9x daily\
    \ traffic swing that must be absorbed seamlessly. The platform delivers P95 latency\
    \ under 500ms, P99 under 1 second, and maintains a 0.002% error rate. Built on\
    \ Kotlin (backend), TypeScript with server-side rendering and ReactJS (frontend),\
    \ the system spans a dual-service architecture with 100+ page routes and 30+ business\
    \ domains including Orders, Payments, Delivery, Cancel/\_Return/Exchange, WOW\
    \ Membership, Travel, and Contact Center.\n\nThe team ships 100+ features monthly,\
    \ supports multi-market business logic across KR and TW (each with region-specific\
    \ compliance, internationalization, and payment methods), and enforces security\
    \ through a 4-phase authorization pipeline. This is a complex, high-stakes\_environment\
    \ where architectural decisions have immediate customer impact.\n\nWhat You Will\
    \ Do\n In this role, you will own the most critical technical challenges on the\
    \ platform: designing multi-market abstractions that scale to new regions, driving\
    \ the system toward 99.99% availability, leading disaster recovery readiness and\
    \ capacity planning across the full\_production fleet, and defining the long-term\
    \ architecture for a platform that must reliably serve billions of requests weekly\
    \ while continuing to evolve. You will directly influence customer retention and\
    \ satisfaction metrics for every Coupang post-purchase interaction,\nset the engineering\
    \ bar for the team, and shape the technical strategy for one of Coupang's most\
    \ customer-facing systems.\n\nBasic Qualifications\_\n\nMinimum 12 years of experience\
    \ working on software design and development in Java.\n\nHands-on experience with\
    \ designing, building, and deploying scalable, high available systems\n\nExperience\
    \ with high-throughput, low-latency systems handling millions of requests\n\n\
    Experience with event-driven architectures using Kafka or similar messaging systems\n\
    \nStrong problem-solving skills and ability to debug complex distributed systems\n\
    \nExcellent collaboration skills to work with cross-functional teams (Product,\
    \ CS, Logistics, Payment)\n\nPreferred Qualifications\_\_\n\nBackend development\
    \ (Java, Kotlin, or similar JVM languages preferred)\n\nRESTful API design and\
    \ implementation\n\nDatabase design and optimization (MySQL,\n\nAurora)Message\
    \ queue systems\n\n(Kafka)Workflow engines (Activiti BPMN, Temporal)\n\nMonitoring\
    \ and alerting (Grafana, CloudWatch)\n\nVersion control\n\n(Git)CI/CD tools (CircleCI\
    \ or similar\n\n\_\n\nType of work model\_\n\nHybrid\n\nDetails to consider\_\n\
    \nThose eligible for employment protection (recipients of veteran’s benefits,\
    \ the disabled, etc.) may receive preferential treatment for employment in accordance\
    \ with applicable laws.\_\n\_\n\nPrivacy Notice\_\_\n\nYour personal information\
    \ will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy\
    \ Notice located below. https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/\_"
