    \ minimizing hallucinations and optimizing large-scale cost-efficiency.\n\nRapidly\
    \ prototype and productionize new AI capabilities to drive innovation and advance\
    \ Coupang's mission to \"build the future of commerce.\"\n\nWhat We’re Looking\
    \ For\n\nRequired Qualifications\n\n3 years of experience in software engineering,\
    \ with solid coding skills and critical code review capabilities, as well as a\
    \ deep specialization in leveraging Large Language Models (LLMs) and Generative\
    \ AI systems and productivity tools.\n\nStrong product-led engineering mindset\
    \ with the ability to bridge the gap between cutting-edge AI research and practical,\
    \ user-centric product features.\n\nProven experience owning end-to-end AI applications,\
    \ including:\n\nGenerative AI agents and conversational interfaces.\n\nRAG (Retrieval-Augmented\
    \ Generation) pipelines.\n\nLLM fine-tuning and optimization for specific domains.\n\
    \nAI-powered automation and workflow systems.\n\nDemonstrated track record of\
    \ taking AI-first products from concept to production, driving measurable improvements\
    \ in user engagement, operational efficiency, or system performance.\n\nDeep technical\
    \ understanding of modern AI stacks, including:\n\nPrompt engineering and LLM\
    \ orchestration frameworks (e.g., LangChain, LlamaIndex).\n\nVector databases\
    \ and semantic search architectures.\n\nScalable MLOps for non-deterministic AI\
    \ models.\n\nPreferred Qualifications\n\nExperience in high-traffic, large-scale\
    \ consumer AI environments (e.g., LLM-based assistants, search/recommendation\
