    \nBuild and maintain systems using diverse technologies such as:\n\nEnsure site\
    \ reliability to deliver a seamless shopping experience\n\nCollaborate within\
    \ a truly global organization across Seoul, Shanghai, Beijing, and San Francisco\n\
    \n\_\n\n\_\n\nBasic Qualifications\n\nBachelor’s degree or higher in Computer\
