    \n\nYour personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as\_stated\
    \ in the Application Privacy Notice located\_HERE.\_\n\nDocument Return Policy\_\
    \n\nThis notification is given pursuant to Article 11 (6) of the Fair Hiring Procedure\
    \ Act.\_\_\n\nA job applicant, who has applied but not been finally selected for\
