    \n\_\n\nBasic Qualifications:\n\nThe ideal candidate has 8+ years of experience\
    \ as an Analyst performing ads data analysis, business analysis, financial analysis,\
    \ market research, and executive reporting.\_\n\nStrong SQL \_\n\nPython or R\_\
    for statistical analysis\n\nHive, Presto, Airflow\_\n\nExcellent quantitative\
